   "slot": "verifiability_narrative",
   "text": "The token's backing is held entirely in assets whose value can be checked directly on-chain, representing 100.0% of the total reserve. This single class comprises the entire collateral pool, with Ethereum (ETH) being the only asset counted within this checkable category.\n\nNo portion of the reserve relies on wrappers for one-layer verification or depends on issuer disclosures, as both those categories hold 0. Consequently, there are no disclosure-dependent nodes to monitor for staleness, and the system reports no disclosure-dependent staleness status.\n\nGovernance rules regarding the backing structure are immutable; no admin power can alter the backing composition. The entire supply of $26.2M is backed by this traced collateral, which includes all troves with an exact identity.",
